! Validation-internal transport selection: the transcribed-Genesis transverse maps
! (fel_tracking = -1) on every FEL element, for the Genesis-comparison tiers, which
! require transcription-level transport. No production lattice writes this value; the
! production default (fel_tracking unset) is the bmad_standard kernel's maps.
call, file = aramis.bmad
wiggler::*[FEL_TRACKING] = -1
